s:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-free nicotine pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWide range of flavors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20mg Nicotine Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSlim and comfortable pouch design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for discreet, on-the-go use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 20 Pouches per can\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Al Fakher","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41801813983287,"sku":"Al Fakher Pouches - Blue Razz Lemonade","price":1299.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/al-fakher-nicotine-blue-razz-lemonade.webp?v=1753906057"},{"product_id":"al-fakher-sweet-passion-fruit-nicotine-pouches","title":"Al Fakher - Sweet Passion Fruit Nicotine Pouches","description":"\u003cp\u003eIndulge in the tropical delight of Sweet Passionfruit Flavoured Al Fakher \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nicotine-pouches-kenya\" title=\"Nicotine Pouches\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eNicotine Pouches\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e. Each pouch delivers a burst of exotic passionfruit flavor, perfectly balanced with a smooth nicotine experience. Ideal for those who crave a fruity escape, these pouches offer a satisfying and refreshing option that makes every use a moment of pleasure. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to Use-\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlace: \u003c\/strong\u003eSimply take a pouch and place it under your lip.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnjoy: \u003c\/strong\u003eAllow the pouch to release its bold flavour and smooth nicotine, providing a satisfying and enjoyable experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDispose:\u003c\/strong\u003e After use, dispose of the pouch responsibly.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-free nicotine pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWide range of flavors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20mg Nicotine Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSlim and comfortable pouch design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for discreet, on-the-go use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 20 Pouches per can\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Al Fakher","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41801817718839,"sku":"Al Fakher Pouches - Sweet Passion Fruit","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/al-fakher-nicotine-pouches-sweet-passion-fruit.webp?v=1753906523"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-wintery-watermelon","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Wintery Watermelon","description":"\u003cp\u003eWatermelon might typically be known as a sweet and juicy fruit, but VELO Wintery Watermelon nicotine pouches adds a slightly different dimension. It has a frosty flavor due to the inclusion of mint, which leaves a tingling sensation in the mouth that creates an icy experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs mini nicotine pouches, the products are smaller than traditional nicotine pouches, meaning they feel less intrusive in the mouth — useful for consumers who don’t want others to notice their pouches or anyone seeking an ergonomic experience. They’re also lightweight, weighing just 0.5 g each.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWintery Watermelon Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mg \u0026amp; 10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41801876013111,"sku":"VELO - Wintery Watermelon","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-wintery-watermelon-nicotine-pouches.webp?v=1753916506"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-bright-spearmint","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Bright Spearmint","description":"\u003cp\u003eBright Spearmint Velo nicotine pouches capture the cool taste of spearmint with a hint of frosty menthol notes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVelo Bright Spearmint nic pouches are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 6mg (9.2mg\/g) and 10mg (15.3mg\/g) strengths per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBright Spearmint Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mg \u0026amp; 10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41801879486519,"sku":"VELO - Bright Spearmint","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Velo-Bright-Spearmint_Open_Nicotine_Pouches.webp?v=1753917052"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-freezing-peppermint","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Freezing Peppermint","description":"\u003cp\u003eFreezing Peppermint Velo nicotine pouches feature cool notes of arctic ice, fused with bold yet sweet peppermint.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVelo Free