he 14mg strength, perfect for moderate users. Conveniently sized and easy to use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith no smoke, smell, or tobacco*, VELO nicotine pouches can be used anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mg Strength (one of the strongest)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990794051639,"sku":"VELO - Tropical Mango","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-tropical-mango-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1763408907"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-ruby-berry","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Ruby Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eVELO nicotine pouches, Ruby Berry offers a blend of strawberries with tones of acidity. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Ruby Berry flavour is available in the 6mg strength, perfect for moderate users. Conveniently sized and easy to use. With no smoke, smell, or tobacco, VELO nicotine pouches can be used anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990795001911,"sku":"VELO - Ruby Berry","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-ruby-berry-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1763409075"},{"product_id":"zyn-nicotine-pouches-cool-mint-mini","title":"ZYN Nicotine Pouches - Cool Mint Mini","description":"\u003cp\u003eCool Mint ZYN nicotine pouches offer a simple minty flavour that provides chilly notes from start to finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZYN Cool Mint pouches don't produce smoke or vapour, so they're the best way to satisfy your nicotine cravings where vaping or smoking isn’t allowed — such as public transport or restaurants. Available in 3mg (7.5mg\/g), 6mg (15mg\/g), 9.5mg (12.9mg\/g) and 11mg (14.9mg\/g) strengths per pouch, ZYN offer both light and medium levels of nicotine. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMint Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mg, 6mg, 9.5mg \u0026amp; 11mg Strengths\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 x Mini Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"9mg","offer_id":42030411710519,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Cool Mint Mini - 9 mg","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/zyn_cool_mint_mini_nicotine_pouches.webp?v=1766445524"},{"product_id":"zyn-nicotine-pouches-cool-mint-slim","title":"ZYN Nicotine Pouches - Cool Mint Slim","description":"\u003cp\u003eCool Mint ZYN nicotine pouches offer a simple minty flavour that provides chilly notes from start to finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZYN Cool Mint pouches don't produce smoke or vapour, so they're the best way to satisfy your nicotine cravings where vaping or smoking isn’t allowed — such as public transport or restaurants. Available in 3mg (7.5mg\/g), 6mg (15mg\/g), 9.5mg (12.9mg\/g) and 11mg (14.9mg\/g) strengths per pouch, ZYN offer both light and medium levels of nicotine. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u