y're the best way to satisfy your nicotine cravings where vaping or smoking isn’t allowed. Available in 3mg (7.5mg\/g), 6mg (15mg\/g), 9.5mg (12.9mg\/g) and 11mg (14.9mg\/g) strengths per pouch, ZYN offer both light and medium levels of nicotine. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack Cherry Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mg, 6mg, 9.5mg \u0026amp; 11mg Strengths\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 x Mini Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"3 mg","offer_id":42197279440951,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Black Cherry Mini - 3 mg","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":42030413119543,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Black Cherry Mini - 6 mg","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/zyn_black_cherry_mini_nicotine_pouches.webp?v=1766445523"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-orange-ice","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Orange Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eVELO's Orange Ice Nicotine Pouches are small in size but large on flavour, featuring a mouth watering combination of sweet cherries and minty menthol creating an irresistible flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFresh Orange Menthol Flavour\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo tobacco, no vapour, no smoke\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10mg Nicotine Strength \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12mm x 38mm in size\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse wherever, whenever.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to a 60-minute nicotine hit\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and convenient to carry around\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan features a compartment to store used pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056481734711,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Orange Ice","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-nicotine-pouches-orange-Ice-slim-10mg.webp?v=1768062437"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-mango-flame","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Mango Flame","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the tropical delight of VELO Mango Flame, a premium nicotine pouch that brings the vibrant essence of mango to your daily routine. Crafted by the renowned VELO brand, this product is a standout in the world of nicotine pouches. Whether you're a seasoned user or new to \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nicotine-pouches-kenya\" title=\"Nic pouches\"\u003enic pouches\u003c\/a\u003e, VELO Mango Flame offers a unique and satisfying experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFresh Mango Menthol Flavour\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo tobacco, no vapour, no smoke\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10mg Nicotine Strength \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12mm x 38mm in size\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse wherever, whenever.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to a 60-minute nicotine hit\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and convenient to carry around\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan features a compartment to store used pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056482881591,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Mango Flame","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-nicotine-pouch-mango-flame.webp?v=1768062719"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-max-x-freeze","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Max X - Freeze","description":"\u003cp\u003eVelo Max X Freeze, Large comes in a nicotine strength of 20 mg per Pouch, and the pouch size is produced in the Large format. As a result, the nicotine content per pouch is significantly higher than usual and especially noticeable. We recommend this product exclusively for experienced users. For beginners and newcomers, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nicotine-pouches-kenya\" title=\"nic pouches kenya\"\u003enic pouches kenya\u003c\/a\u003e with a nicotine strength of up to 2 points is the better choice!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFresh Menthol Flavour\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo tobacco, no vapour, no smoke\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20mg Nicotine Strength \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12mm x 38mm in size\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse wherever, whenever.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to a 60-minute nicotine hit\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and convenient to carry around\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan features a compartment to store used pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056485437495,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Max X Freeze","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-x-freeze-max-nic-pouch.webp?v=1768063265"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-ice-cool","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Ice Cool","description":"\u003cp\u003eVelo nicotine pouches are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 10mg strength per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056486125623,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Ice Cool","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-ice-cool-10mg-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1768063989"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-tangled-berry","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Tangled Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eVelo nicotine pouches are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 10mg strength per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056518041655,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Tangled Berry","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-tangled-berry-nicotine-pouch_5a93510a-b6ed-4735-baeb-696d026a358e.webp?v=1768064579"},{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-max-freeze","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Max Freeze","description":"\u003cp\u003eVelo - Freeze MAX is a top product with a really great flavour combination of icy menthol and fresh peppermint. You could say this won't leave anyone cold, but I won't, because these pouches really do leave your mouth feeling freezy and icy for a long time. Shop \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nicotine-pouches-kenya\" title=\"Nicotine pouches Kenya\"\u003enicotine pouches Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e at best price with [YOUR BRAND].\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e17mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42060690751543,"sku":"VELO - Max Freeze","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-freeze-max.webp?v=1768411048"},{"product_id":"vito-watermelon-17mg","title":"VITO - Watermelon 17mg","description":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eSavor the juicy, sweet taste of summer with VITO nicotine pouches Watermelon. These nicotine pouches deliver the essence of fresh watermelon in every pouch, offering a smooth and satisfying way to enjoy nicotine. Perfect for anyone looking for a light, refreshing flavor. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e17mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VITO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42110441291831,"sku":"VITO - Watermelon 17mg","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/059